ionNode","statementID":"1720917003","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"好的！报告侦探老师，我、我发现了重大情报！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1720917004:1":{"key":"say:6:1720917004:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1720917004","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"德米特子爵每周都会花时间去跟他的神秘情人见面！虽然不知...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1720917005:1":{"key":"say:7:1720917005:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1720917005","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"还有，德米特子爵表面上看起来严肃，私下里居然会偷偷收集...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice_prompt:8:1720917005":{"key":"choice_prompt:8:1720917005","kind":"choice_prompt","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.MultiChooseNode","statementID":"1720917005","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"还有，德米特子爵表面上看起来严肃，私下里居然会偷偷收集各种款式的蕾丝手帕！而且他还给他的宠物猫取名叫“小甜心”，每天都要……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:9:1720917006:1":{"key":"say:9:1720917006:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","state